{"path":"/documentation/ndif","section":"documentation","title":"ndif","description":"Documentation for the nnsight Python library","toc":[{"id":"nnsight.ndif","label":"ndif","depth":2},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.CRITICAL_PACKAGES","label":"CRITICAL_PACKAGES\n\n\n  \n      module-attribute","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus","label":"NdifStatus","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison","label":"EnvComparison","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.register","label":"register","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.resolve_host","label":"resolve_host","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.status","label":"status","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.ndif_status","label":"ndif_status","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.is_model_running","label":"is_model_running","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.whoami","label":"whoami","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.login","label":"login","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.main","label":"main","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.get_local_env","label":"get_local_env","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.get_remote_env","label":"get_remote_env","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.pull_env","label":"pull_env","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.build_table","label":"build_table","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.ndif.compare","label":"compare","depth":3}],"segments":[{"type":"html","html":"<h2 id=\"nnsight.ndif\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-module\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-module-name\">ndif</span>\n\n\n</h2>"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Top-level NDIF helpers.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>register</code> — ship a local module with a remote request (serialize by value).</li>\n<li><code>status</code> / <a title=\"            is_model_running\" href=\"#nnsight.ndif.is_model_running\"><code>is_model_running</code></a> — query the NDIF service and its models.</li>\n<li><a title=\"            compare\" href=\"#nnsight.ndif.compare\"><code>compare</code></a> / <a title=\"            get_remote_env\" href=\"#nnsight.ndif.get_remote_env\"><code>get_remote_env</code></a> — diff the local Python environment\n  against a server's; each server's environment is cached per host.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Tables render as plain text with optional ANSI color (matching\n<a title=\"            display\" href=\"/documentation/intervention/backends/display#nnsight.intervention.backends.display\"><code>nnsight.intervention.backends.display</code></a>); no <code>rich</code> dependency. Network\nlibraries are imported lazily so importing nnsight stays light.</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.CRITICAL_PACKAGES\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">CRITICAL_PACKAGES</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-module-attribute\"><code>module-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"CRITICAL_PACKAGES = {'nnsight', 'transformers', 'torch'}"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">NdifStatus</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"NdifStatus(deployments: dict)"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>A view of NDIF's deployed models, with a formatted table on <code>print</code>.</p>\n<p><code>deployments</code> maps repo id -&gt; <code>{model_class, repo_id, task,\ntrust_remote_code, revision, level, state, hot_replicas}</code> for each HOT/WARM\nmodel; <code>status</code> is the derived service\nstate. Indexing/iteration delegate to <code>deployments</code> for convenience.\nReplicas of one deployment fold into one entry (healthiest state wins;\n<code>hot_replicas</code> counts the HOT ones). A\ncheckpoint deployed under several tasks appears once per task, keyed\n<code>\"repo_id (task)\"</code> — with the revision joining the key when the tasks\ntie, and <code>trust_remote_code</code> when those tie too.</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.deployments\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">deployments</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"deployments = deployments"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.status\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">status</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"status = self._derive_status()"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.Status\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">Status</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"html","html":"<p class=\"doc-class-bases\">\n              Bases: <code><span title=\"str\">str</span></code>, <code><span title=\"enum.Enum\">Enum</span></code></p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h5 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.Status.UP\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">UP</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-class-attribute\"><code>class-attribute</code></small>\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h5>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"UP = 'UP'"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h5 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.Status.REDEPLOYING\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">REDEPLOYING</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-class-attribute\"><code>class-attribute</code></small>\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h5>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"REDEPLOYING = 'REDEPLOYING'"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h5 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.Status.DOWN\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">DOWN</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-class-attribute\"><code>class-attribute</code></small>\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h5>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"DOWN = 'DOWN'"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.__getitem__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__getitem__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__getitem__(key: str) -> dict"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.__iter__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__iter__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__iter__()"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.__contains__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__contains__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__contains__(key: str) -> bool"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.__len__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__len__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__len__() -> int"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.keys\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">keys</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"keys()"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.__str__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__str__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__str__() -> str"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus.__repr__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__repr__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__repr__() -> str"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">EnvComparison</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"EnvComparison(local_env: dict, remote_env: dict)"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>A local-vs-remote environment diff, inspectable and printable.</p>\n<p>Printing shows the Python-version line and the package table. Inspect the\nstructured result directly:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>local</code> / <code>remote</code> — the raw env dicts.</li>\n<li><code>local_python</code> / <code>remote_python</code> / <code>python_matches</code>.</li>\n<li><code>packages</code> — <code>{pkg: {\"local\", \"remote\", \"match\", \"critical\"}}</code> for every\n  package the server has.</li>\n<li><code>mismatches</code> / <code>critical_mismatches</code> — the differing subset.</li>\n</ul>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison.local\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">local</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"local = local_env"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison.remote\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">remote</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"remote = remote_env"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison.local_python\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">local_python</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"local_python = local_env.get('python_version', 'Unknown').split()[0]"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison.remote_python\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">remote_python</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"remote_python = remote_env.get('python_version', 'Unknown').split()[0]"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison.packages\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">packages</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"packages = {pkg: {'local': local_pkgs.get(pkg, '-'), 'remote': remote_pkgs[pkg], 'match': local_pkgs.get(pkg, '-') == remote_pkgs[pkg], 'critical': pkg.lower() in CRITICAL_PACKAGES} for pkg in remote_pkgs}"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison.python_matches\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">python_matches</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-property\"><code>property</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"python_matches: bool"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison.mismatches\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">mismatches</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-property\"><code>property</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"mismatches: dict"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison.critical_mismatches\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">critical_mismatches</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-property\"><code>property</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"critical_mismatches: dict"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison.__str__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__str__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__str__() -> str"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison.__repr__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__repr__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__repr__() -> str"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.register\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">register</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"register(module: Any) -> None"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Register a local module for serialization by value in remote execution.</p>\n<p>Code submitted to NDIF that imports a module not installed on the server\nwould raise <code>ModuleNotFoundError</code>. Registering the module ships its class\nand function <em>source</em> with the request so it's rebuilt server-side. Thin\nwrapper over <code>cloudpickle.register_pickle_by_value</code> (the serializer nnsight\nuses honors it).</p>\n\n\n<table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th><span class=\"doc-section-title\">PARAMETER</span></th>\n          <th><span>DESCRIPTION</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <code>module</code>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-param-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>The module object, or its name as a string.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"typing.Any\">Any</span></code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n        <p>Example::</p>"},{"type":"code","lang":"text","code":"import mymodule\nimport nnsight\nnnsight.register(mymodule)           # or nnsight.register(\"mymodule\")\n\nwith model.trace(\"Hello\", remote=True):\n    out = mymodule.myfn(model).save()"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.resolve_host\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">resolve_host</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"resolve_host(host: Optional[str] = None) -> str"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p><code>host</code>, or the configured one, without a trailing slash: the one spelling\nrequest URLs and the per-host environment cache use.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.status\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">status</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"status(raw: bool = False) -> Union[dict, NdifStatus]"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Query the NDIF service and its deployed models.</p>\n<p>Printing the returned <a title=\"            NdifStatus\" href=\"#nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus\"><code>NdifStatus</code></a> shows a table of the currently\ndeployed (HOT/WARM) models and their state.</p>\n\n\n<table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th><span class=\"doc-section-title\">PARAMETER</span></th>\n          <th><span>DESCRIPTION</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <code>raw</code>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-param-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>If <code>True</code>, return the raw <code>/status</code> JSON instead of an\n<a title=\"            NdifStatus\" href=\"#nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus\"><code>NdifStatus</code></a>.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"bool\">bool</span></code>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-default\">\n                    <b>DEFAULT:</b>\n                      <code>False</code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n\n<table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th><span class=\"doc-section-title\">RETURNS</span></th>\n          <th><span>DESCRIPTION</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <span class=\"doc-returns-annotation\">\n                    <code><span title=\"typing.Union\">Union</span>[<span title=\"dict\">dict</span>, <a title=\"            NdifStatus (nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus)\" href=\"#nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus\">NdifStatus</a>]</code>\n                </span>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-returns-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>The raw dict (<code>raw=True</code>), else an <a title=\"            NdifStatus\" href=\"#nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus\"><code>NdifStatus</code></a> (empty, with a</p>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <span class=\"doc-returns-annotation\">\n                    <code><span title=\"typing.Union\">Union</span>[<span title=\"dict\">dict</span>, <a title=\"            NdifStatus (nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus)\" href=\"#nnsight.ndif.NdifStatus\">NdifStatus</a>]</code>\n                </span>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-returns-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p><code>DOWN</code> status, if the service is unreachable).</p>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n\n<p><span class=\"doc-section-title\">Examples:</span></p>"},{"type":"code","lang":"pycon","code":">>> import nnsight\n>>> print(nnsight.status())          # table of deployed models\n>>> \"openai-community/gpt2\" in nnsight.status()"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.ndif_status\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">ndif_status</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"ndif_status(raw: bool = False) -> Union[dict, NdifStatus]"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Deprecated: use <code>status</code>.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.is_model_running\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">is_model_running</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"is_model_running(repo_id: str, revision: str = 'main', task: Optional[str] = None, trust_remote_code: Optional[bool] = None) -> bool"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Whether <code>repo_id</code> (at <code>revision</code>) is currently RUNNING on NDIF.</p>\n<p>Returns <code>False</code> if the service is unreachable. The repo id is canonicalized\nvia the Hub so different spellings match the deployed key. <code>task</code> and\n<code>trust_remote_code</code> narrow the check to one deployment, since both are\npart of the model key; unset, any value counts.</p>\n\n\n<p><span class=\"doc-section-title\">Examples:</span></p>"},{"type":"code","lang":"pycon","code":">>> import nnsight\n>>> nnsight.is_model_running(\"openai-community/gpt2\")\n>>> nnsight.is_model_running(\"openai-community/gpt2\", task=\"text-generation\")\n>>> nnsight.is_model_running(\"x/custom\", trust_remote_code=True)"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.whoami\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">whoami</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"whoami(api_key: Optional[str] = None) -> dict"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Resolve the identity NDIF associates with an API key.</p>\n<p>Calls the service's <code>/whoami</code> endpoint and returns <code>{\"email\": ..., \"tags\":\n[...]}</code>. <code>email</code> is <code>None</code> when the key is unrecognized (or the server has\nkey validation disabled). Uses the configured key (<code>CONFIG.API.APIKEY</code>) when\n<code>api_key</code> isn't given.</p>\n\n\n<table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th><span class=\"doc-section-title\">PARAMETER</span></th>\n          <th><span>DESCRIPTION</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <code>api_key</code>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-param-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>The key to resolve; defaults to the configured one.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"typing.Optional\">Optional</span>[<span title=\"str\">str</span>]</code>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-default\">\n                    <b>DEFAULT:</b>\n                      <code>None</code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n\n<table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th><span class=\"doc-section-title\">RETURNS</span></th>\n          <th><span>DESCRIPTION</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <span class=\"doc-returns-annotation\">\n                    <code><span title=\"dict\">dict</span></code>\n                </span>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-returns-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>The <code>/whoami</code> identity dict, <code>{\"email\": str | None, \"tags\": list}</code>.</p>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.login\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">login</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"login(api_key: Optional[str] = None) -> None"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Store your NDIF API key so future sessions can use it (HuggingFace-style).</p>\n<p>Prompts for the key with <code>getpass</code> (never echoed) when not given, verifies it\nagainst the service via <a title=\"            whoami\" href=\"#nnsight.ndif.whoami\"><code>whoami</code></a>, then persists it with\n<code>CONFIG.set_default_api_key</code> (which writes <code>config.yaml</code>). Verification is\nbest-effort — the key is still saved if the service can't be reached or doesn't\nrecognize it, with a note — so a typo is surfaced without blocking login.</p>\n\n\n<table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th><span class=\"doc-section-title\">PARAMETER</span></th>\n          <th><span>DESCRIPTION</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <code>api_key</code>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-param-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>The NDIF API key. Prompted for (hidden) when not given; empty input\nis a no-op that saves nothing.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"typing.Optional\">Optional</span>[<span title=\"str\">str</span>]</code>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-default\">\n                    <b>DEFAULT:</b>\n                      <code>None</code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n\n<p><span class=\"doc-section-title\">Examples:</span></p>"},{"type":"code","lang":"pycon","code":">>> from nnsight import login\n>>> login()\nEnter your NDIF API key:\nNDIF API key saved — logged in as you@example.com."},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.main\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">main</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"main() -> None"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Console entry point for the <code>nnsight</code> command (<code>login</code> / <code>whoami</code>).</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.get_local_env\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">get_local_env</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"get_local_env() -> dict"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>The local Python version and installed packages (by import name).</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.get_remote_env\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">get_remote_env</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"get_remote_env(host: Optional[str] = None, *, force_refresh: bool = False) -> dict"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>An NDIF server's Python version and installed packages (default: the\nconfigured host), fetched once per host.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.pull_env\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">pull_env</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"pull_env() -> None"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Auto-register local (non-installed) modules for serialize-by-value, once.</p>\n<p>The remote backend calls this before its first request: every module\n<a title=\"            get_local_env\" href=\"#nnsight.ndif.get_local_env\"><code>get_local_env</code></a> discovers as <code>\"local\"</code> (importable from the working\ntree, not a pip install) is passed to <code>register</code>, so its source ships\nwith remote requests. Without it, remote code that imports a local module\nraises <code>ModuleNotFoundError</code> server-side. Cached via <code>_PULLED_ENV</code> so the\n(cheap but non-trivial) local-env scan runs only once per process.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.build_table\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">build_table</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"build_table(local_env: dict, remote_env: dict) -> str"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>A package version-comparison table (local vs remote) as plain text.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.ndif.compare\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">compare</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"compare(host: Optional[str] = None) -> EnvComparison"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Compare the local Python environment with an NDIF server's.</p>\n<p>Package or Python-version drift between client and server can make\ninterventions behave differently remotely than locally; this surfaces it.</p>\n<p>Returns an <a title=\"            EnvComparison\" href=\"#nnsight.ndif.EnvComparison\"><code>EnvComparison</code></a> — <code>print</code> it for the table, or inspect\n<code>.mismatches</code> / <code>.critical_mismatches</code> / <code>.python_matches</code>.</p>\n\n\n<table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th><span class=\"doc-section-title\">PARAMETER</span></th>\n          <th><span>DESCRIPTION</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <code>host</code>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-param-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>The server to compare against; defaults to the configured host.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"typing.Optional\">Optional</span>[<span title=\"str\">str</span>]</code>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-default\">\n                    <b>DEFAULT:</b>\n                      <code>None</code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n\n<p><span class=\"doc-section-title\">Examples:</span></p>"},{"type":"code","lang":"pycon","code":">>> import nnsight\n>>> print(nnsight.compare())         # local vs remote package table\n>>> nnsight.compare().critical_mismatches\n>>> nnsight.compare(\"http://localhost:5001\").packages[\"nnterp\"]"}]}